1
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:29,960
I've never seen

2
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:32,200
Purple Vine in person.

3
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:35,160
Every time before selling a painting,

4
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:37,840
she would call me from a public phone,

5
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:39,280
asking me to pick up the painting

6
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:40,880
at the usual place.

7
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:44,840
The sixth building

8
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:47,360
of the 23rd staff compound of the chemical fiber factory

9
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:48,680
in the old town.

10
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:15,600
The adoption agreement of Sunshine Orphanage.

11
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:21,320
But why is the name of the adoptee missing?

12
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,440
[Broken heel.]

13
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,120
[Purple vine.]

14
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,160
Where is it?

15
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,320
Why is it missing?

16
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:09,600
Isn't Mr. Liu the chief designer of women's wear?

17
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:11,120
Why are you also the chief designer of women's wear?

18
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,040
Are you new here?

19
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,280
You don't even know me.

20
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:14,400
Let me tell you.

21
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:17,520
I'm the chief designer of women's wear appointed by the Old Madam.

22
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:18,720
My work

23
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,560
have won awards in Japan's

24
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:22,480
top designer art exhibitions.

25
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:25,160
Isn't that a fake award?

26
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:25,800
You...

27
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:27,440
Where's the sample of Dark Fairy Tale?

28
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,000
Why are you yelling?

29
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:31,080
You scared me.

30
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:33,640
A key was missing when I handed over the office keys.

31
00:04:34,080 --> 00:04:35,000
You stole it, didn't you?

32
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:35,840
Oh,

33
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,200
don't just say anything.

34
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:37,880
Watch out.

35
00:04:37,880 --> 00:04:38,480
I'll sue you for defamation.

36
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,960
I installed a camera in my office.

37
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:41,840
I took it.

38
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:42,960
So what?

39
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:43,880
Hmm.

40
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:45,240
Give it back to me.

41
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:47,720
Your designs

42
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:48,800
are garbage.

43
00:04:49,440 --> 00:04:50,400
The princesses

44
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:51,600
definitely don't like them.

45
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:53,400
I've already

46
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:54,400
destroyed them.

47
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,720
Are you trying to complain to Zhou Jian?

48
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:02,240
I don't care

49
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:03,600
about the supervising work.

50
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,360
I've already told the former chairman.

51
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,600
This young master

52
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,440
doesn't even bother to deal with you.

53
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,640
You've done quite a thorough investigation.

54
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,320
Hmm.

55
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:15,840
Hello?

56
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,240
What?

57
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,280
What are you talking about?

58
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:22,600
Hello.

59
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:23,280
Young Master.

60
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,160
Well,

61
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:25,000
long time no see.

62
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:26,600
Who are you?

63
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:27,240
I...

64
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,000
Come to the company.

65
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:29,320
Why should I?

66
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:30,120
This isn't a request,

67
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:30,800
this is a threat!

68
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:32,280
Jiang Li, how dare you talk to me like that!

69
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:47,760
Oh, young master,

70
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:49,000
this is just a small matter,

71
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:50,000
don't...

72
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:50,480
Don't touch me!

73
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:51,440
Don't come any closer!

74
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,520
If you come any closer, I'll break your leg!

75
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:56,200
Hmph!

76
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:01,600
Jiang Li,

77
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,960
You'd better have something urgent.

78
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:07,360
He destroyed the initial draft of Dark Fairy Tale.

79
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:08,280
Hmph.

80
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:11,040
You should handle this yourself.

81
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,000
Oh, dear.

82
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:20,560
We are good sisters.

83
00:06:20,760 --> 00:06:21,400
I was just

84
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:23,040
messing around with you.

85
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:23,840
Baby.

86
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,680
He's with the Old Lady.

87
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,160
I have something to do.

88
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:42,120
I'm leaving.

89
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:43,840
You two have a good talk.

90
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:46,280
Jenny.

91
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:48,320
Yes?

92
00:06:50,880 --> 00:06:52,080
Take a long vacation.

93
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,240
What?

94
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:54,200
Young Master,

95
00:06:54,200 --> 00:06:54,720
are you kidding me?

96
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:56,520
I told you not to touch me.

97
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:58,200
Hmph!

98
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:09,600
Are you done?

99
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:12,000
After your sister and Zhou Jian's wedding,

100
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,360
I'm moving into the Lu family.

101
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:18,840
Don't push your luck.

102
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:26,800
Are you threatening me?

103
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,880
It's just a fair exchange.

104
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:54,040
You first.

105
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,640
Pay 31.8 yuan.

106
00:08:05,640 --> 00:08:05,920
Take it.

107
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:06,560
Thank you.

108
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,840
Thank you.

109
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:26,840
Why are you staring at me?

110
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:29,000
Is there a financial statement on my face?

111
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,040
I'm just thinking that

112
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:32,400
the life-saving favor

113
00:08:32,560 --> 00:08:34,360
is paid back with a convenience store lunch box.

114
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:37,240
Because the lunch box is the most practical

115
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,120
and can fill me up.

116
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,600
You are the most special rich second generation I've ever seen.

117
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:01,480
Do you like Lu Xu?

118
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,840
I'd be crazy to like him.

119
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:10,720
Then why are you engaged to him?

120
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:12,280
You...

121
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,280
Do you really want to marry him?

122
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:14,960
For money.

123
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,200
For the property of the Lu family.

124
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:17,480
Am I direct enough?

125
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,480
You're lying.

126
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:20,520
Your eyes tell me.

127
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:21,160
You're not the kind of person

128
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:22,480
sell yourself for money.

129
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:28,520
You rich second-generation

130
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:30,240
are always so self-righteous.

131
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:33,000
Don't think that you know me well

132
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:34,920
just because you've met me twice.

133
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:38,440
I can't empathize with what you've been through,

134
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:40,040
and you can't empathize with what I've been through.

135
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:45,400
Sorry,

136
00:09:57,040 --> 00:09:57,880
I'm done eating.

137
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:02,840
I'll leave first.

138
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:06,240
Let me give you a ride.

139
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,680
I'm driving.

140
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:20,240
If you need any help,

141
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,320
just let me know.

142
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:23,040
Favor is the hardest to repay.

143
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:26,760
A bento is enough.

144
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:20,560
Dad,

145
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:22,120
look at my new toy car.

146
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:25,560
Where did you get it?

147
00:11:26,160 --> 00:11:27,240
Did mom buy it for you?

148
00:11:27,760 --> 00:11:28,800
Uncle bought it.

149
00:11:31,880 --> 00:11:32,760
Go play by yourself.

150
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:34,040
Daddy has work to do.

151
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:34,840
So busy?

152
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,280
Tell Mom

153
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:37,640
I won't be home for dinner tonight.

154
00:11:37,640 --> 00:11:38,320
Uncle,

155
00:11:38,640 --> 00:11:39,960
do you like the toy car?

156
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:41,120
I like it.

157
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:43,440
A child's growth

158
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:44,880
needs a father's company.

159
00:11:52,640 --> 00:11:53,800
Mumu is my son.

160
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:56,080
I don't need you to teach me

161
00:11:56,680 --> 00:11:58,440
how to get along with my son.

162
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:01,840
Come on, Mumu.

163
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:03,360
Daddy won't go out.

164
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:04,320
After dinner,

165
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,680
I'll watch Father and Son with you.

166
00:12:05,680 --> 00:12:06,000
Okay.

167
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:06,640
By the way,

168
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:09,200
after your wedding,

169
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:10,720
Jiang Li will move in.

170
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:12,600
I'm going to marry her.

171
00:12:15,880 --> 00:12:16,560
Congratulations.

172
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:17,320
Are you sure

173
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:19,320
about Jiang Li?

174
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:24,080
Don't move.

175
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:26,520
This wig is your talisman.

176
00:13:29,880 --> 00:13:31,120
If Jiang Li

177
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:33,520
really makes Zhou Jian divorce Lu Qianqian...

178
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:35,120
And then?

179
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:36,680
what are you going to do?

180
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:39,080
Will you abandon me?

181
00:13:41,560 --> 00:13:42,880
In a couple of days,

182
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:45,280
Jiang Li will move into the Lu Family's old house.

183
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:46,880
At that time,

184
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:48,720
you help me keep an eye on her.

185
00:13:49,160 --> 00:13:50,600
Keep her away from my sister.

186
00:13:52,400 --> 00:13:53,600
Aren't you afraid

187
00:13:53,880 --> 00:13:55,520
Jiang Li will lose control?

188
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:21,920
Here are President Zhou's recent spending records.

189
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:25,200
Can I ask you a question?

190
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:27,280
It depends on what the question is.

191
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:28,800
What's your purpose

192
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:31,520
in the Lu Family?
